#
# sustained demo - krpsim
#
# Two-process self-sustaining cycle:
#
#   mine   : consumes 1 ore,  produces 2 ore + 1 gem  (net: +1 ore/cycle)
#   craft  : consumes 2 gems, produces 1 jewel + 1 ore (net: uses gems, returns ore)
#
# The loop never starves: mine always regenerates more ore than it consumes.
# Stop condition: max_time (passed as CLI delay argument).
# Expected result: jewel count in final stocks proves the cycle ran many times.
#
ore:4
#
mine:(ore:1):(ore:2;gem:1):2
craft:(gem:2):(jewel:1;ore:1):3
#
optimize:(jewel)
#
